cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DPE Catalogue: Data Protection Exposures"
abstract: >-
  A catalogue of numbered faults in how systems handle personal data, for what is
  not a security vulnerability and therefore has no CVE. Each entry states the
  mechanism, a deterministic indicator, the conditions a measurement must meet,
  what would refute it, and how to reproduce it without the catalogue's own
  tooling. Entries name no organisation and carry no severity.
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://totaledigitalewaarborging.nl/register"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Apolloccrypt/dpe-registry"
authors:
  - family-names: Beer
    given-names: Mick
keywords:
  - data protection
  - privacy
  - GDPR
  - ePrivacy
  - measurement
  - telemetry
  - reproducibility
